# The factory's scripts must keep LF line endings in every checkout. Git for
# Windows usually has core.autocrlf=true, which would turn the shebang into
# `python3\r` and `set -euo pipefail` into `pipefail\r`, and both then fail
# under Git Bash. Copy this file along with the rest of factory/.
bin/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
